  "description": "Channel-agnostic ASP.NET Core identity wiring for the Stratara stack — AddAspNetIdentity and AddAspNetIdentityWithSignInManager extensions, IStrataraSignInManager wrapper, EF stores, i18n'd failure messages, optional passkey support. Consumers wire their own AuthenticationStateProvider (Blazor Server, MAUI, etc.).",
